# K6 Load Test Results

This directory contains timestamped results from k6 load tests.

Results are automatically stored here when running tests via the Makefile:
- `predict_YYYYMMDD_HHMMSS.txt` - Default predict.js test results
- `randomized_YYYYMMDD_HHMMSS.txt` - Randomized payload test results
- `arrival_rate_YYYYMMDD_HHMMSS.txt` - Arrival-rate (RPS) test results

Files are named with timestamps for easy tracking of test runs over time.
